    "preamble": "Kishan Lal & Ors. vs Fso on 23 November, 2021 In The Court Of Sh. Dinesh Kumar Sharma Principal District & Sessions Judge/ Food Safety Appellate Tribunal New Delhi Fsat No.05/2021 Kishan Lal & Ors. Vs Fso Kishan Lal & Ors. .....Appellants Versus Food Safety Officer .....Respondent Date of filing :05.07.2021 Date of arguments :23.11.2021 Date of Judgment :23.11.2021 Judgment",
    "facts": "",
    "arguments": "The appellants have challenged the impugned order on the ground that the allegation as to misbranding is totally baseless as this is the Govt. of India directive that \"iodine helps mental development\". Chief PP for respondent has opposed the appeal on the ground that the AO has taken into account the relevant rules and has rightly imposed the penalty upon the appellants.",
